# TM10: TM9 plus the support-car playmaking demo / bump reward. Approved by
# the user Nov 21 2026 ("Put that in tm10 and run tm10").
# Reward tm10.toml (extends tm9.toml): playmaking_demo 150, playmaking_bump 20,
# support car only (2v2 last man, 3v3 second man), attacking context, victim
# in the play, <= 4000 uu from the ball, cap 2 per car per episode,
# individual, ramp 0.25 -> 1 over 200M. Train train_tm10.toml (= train_tm9).
# Obs 270. Start = TM9's last checkpoint (START_CK from tm10_after_tm9.sh;
# $R_/TM10_START_CK overrides). BT = team_best = TM7 final, pinned in the
# launcher. Passivity alarm base = TM9's final (PASSIVE_BASE below).
#
# TM9 (EXPERIMENTS.md "TM9 — Cross-exam note"): TM8 plus the 3v3 kickoff
# same-pad / one-corner fix. Approved by the user Nov 20 2026, 3:58 PM ET.
# Reward tm9.toml (extends tm8.toml): kickoff_same_pad 5.0, kickoff_one_corner,
# kickoff_scale_grace_s 3.0 for boost terms only, contact_quality baked to 100,
# term_ramp held at TM8 end values (contact_quality / shadow_cover scale 1.0).
# Train train_tm9.toml: same setters and PFSP 65/20/15 + clamps as TM8.
# Obs 270 (warm start as is). Start = TM8's last checkpoint (passed as
# START_CK by tm9_after_tm8.sh; $R_/TM9_START_CK overrides). BT = team_best
# = TM7 final (exp_TM7/checkpoints/1795170349), pinned in team_launch_tm9.sh.
# 1 epoch, no bf16, CHUNK 100M; critic warm-up 20M; 5B steps, LR 5e-5 held to
# STEPS-1B then 1B cosine to 0.4x.
OBS_PRED=1
GAMMA=0.995; TPI=300_000; MB=100_000; LR=5e-5; ENT=0.016; OPPCH=0.50; PASTW=1.0
HOLDREL=4000000000; DECAY=1_000_000_000; MINLR=0.4; WARM_REL=${WARM_REL:-20000000}
STEPS=${STEPS:-5000000000}; TPI=${TPI_OVERRIDE:-$TPI}
B0=${B0:-/opt/dlami/nvme/ippo_bins/indococo-train-tm10-cf02e2b}
REWARD_TMPL=${REWARD_TMPL:-tm10.toml}; TRAIN_TMPL=${TRAIN_TMPL:-train_tm10.toml}
R_=${R:-/home/ubuntu/ippo_runs}
START_IS_TEAM=${START_IS_TEAM:-1}
TBF=$(cat $R_/team_best/FINAL_CKPT 2>/dev/null || true)
[[ -n "$TBF" && -s "$TBF/actor.bpk" ]] || TBF=""
START_CK=${START_CK:-}
[[ -s $R_/TM10_START_CK ]] && START_CK=$(cat $R_/TM10_START_CK)
TM3F=$(cat $R_/tm3_final/FINAL_CKPT 2>/dev/null || true)
[[ -n "$TM3F" && -s "$TM3F/actor.bpk" ]] || TM3F=""
# League (PFSP [pfsp] in train_tm9.toml decides the shares; the static weights
# below only matter if PFSP is off): Nexto (20% of its episodes sampled),
# Galactus, TM3 final (270-wide). Necto, Megabyte, ST25 1v1 and TM2 final are
# out of the training league (still evaluated at every mid).
GAL_WEIGHT=0.21
NEXTO_WEIGHT=0.30; NEXTO_STOCH=0.2
unset MEGA_WEIGHT NECTO_WEIGHT NECTO_STOCH
EXTRA_OPPS="${TM3F:+TM3_final:$TM3F:0.20}"
CHUNK=${CHUNK:-100000000}
# Passive alarm (team_launch_tm9.sh), any rule for 2 mids in a row ->
# $X/PASSIVE_ALARM: TM8's rules and thresholds (passes 2v2 < 0.85 / 3v3 < 1.30;
# deep > 0.56 / 0.73 with h2h < 0.48; Nexto 2v2 < 0.40 / 3v3 < 0.20; near2 <
# 0.06 / 0.10; no-challenger > 1.5x NCR_BASE = 0.061 / 0.049) with h2h vs
# BEST-team (now TM7 final) < 0.50, plus passivity vs TM8's final: touches per
# car-minute < (1 - TOUCH_DROP) x base, deepest-car depth < (1 - DEPTH_DROP) x
# base, per mode. PASSIVE_BASE is written by tm9_after_tm8.sh at cut-over.
NCR_BASE_2=0.0404; NCR_BASE_3=0.0329
H2H_ALARM=0.50
PASSIVE_BASE=${PASSIVE_BASE:-/opt/dlami/nvme/tm10_work/cut/passive_base.json}
TOUCH_DROP=0.15; DEPTH_DROP=0.20
BT_PIN=${BT_PIN:-/home/ubuntu/ippo_runs/exp_TM7/checkpoints/1795170349}
